# === TWO SEPARATE VERCEL PROJECTS ===

# 1. CLIENT PROJECT (eugenio-client/)
# Deploy separately from eugenio-client/
# Environment variables go in Vercel dashboard

## VITE_API_BASE_URL
## The base URL of your deployed API server (without /api path)
## Examples:
## - Dev: http://localhost:5000
## - Production: https://your-server.vercel.app


# 2. SERVER PROJECT (eugenio-server/)
# Deploy separately from eugenio-server/
# Environment variables go in Vercel dashboard

## MONGODB_URI
## MongoDB Atlas connection string
## Get from: https://www.mongodb.com/cloud/atlas
## Example: mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/dbname?retryWrites=true&w=majority

## JWT_SECRET
## Secret key for JWT authentication (generate a random string)
## You can use: openssl rand -base64 32
## Example: your_random_jwt_secret_here_32_chars

## NODE_ENV
## Set to "production" for deployed instance
## Example: production
